// A parsed function's token span and node, beside `prog` as parsed (the
// columns are described with the case columns, func/cases/more/lit/cons/
// bound/more/state.id). Filed here because ../decl/more.id, which calls it,
// is at the three-function cap.
ptok_note(int ptok_first, int ptok_last, int ptok_node) {
  push((import ptoks), ptok_first);
  push((import ptoke), ptok_last);
  push((import pnodes), ptok_node);
} return void;
